TITLE Albite kinetics + H2S(g) fixed P; I at step 100
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    Fe(+3) 4e-3
    Fe(+2) 4e-3
    -water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    -volume 1
    H2S(g) 5
KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -tol 1e-12
        -steps 10 in 100
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.csv
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -ionic_strength true
END
